        <mxCell id="zln8bCeKP06udvcQpvkK-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204); background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; line-height: 18px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Banking system&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #6796e6;&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt; website / app where you can transfer money from one account to other&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #6796e6;&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt; There would be a user who has details like userid, password, lastlogin etc&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #6796e6;&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt; For each user there can be multiple bank accounts assoiciated with them &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #6796e6;&quot;&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt; For each bank account, there would be account id, iifsc code, branch name , type of account(savings/current)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #6796e6;&quot;&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt; A user can also have different card details like Credit card, debit card etc to pay off their debts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="20" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
